- `IDockingService` - Contract (Cyrena.Components.Core)
- `EventPipeline` - Pub/sub system (Cyrena.Core)
- `KernelComponentBase` - Base class for dockable components (Cyrena.Components.Core)
- `ComponentAssistantsPlugin` - Plugin that registers this service
